menu "SD storage"

    config SD_STORAGE_DMA_BUFFER_SIZE
        int "Persistent SDMMC DMA bounce buffer (bytes)"
        range 0 32768
        default 0
        help
            Internal DMA-capable buffer handed to the SDMMC driver at mount
            (sdmmc_host_t::dma_aligned_buffer). The driver copies every
            transfer to or from a PSRAM buffer through it. With 0 the driver
            instead mallocs and frees a buffer (up to 8 KB) on every such call.
            Off by default: measured 2026-09-26, 8 KB here cost 8 KB of idle
            internal RAM and did not raise the playback low-water mark
            (10.6 KB vs 11.3 KB without it). Must be a multiple of 512.

endmenu
